WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.956
On a posting, click the icon, then Analyze.

2
00:00:02.956 --> 00:00:06.608
Score and call on top; green is a plus, red a minus.

3
00:00:06.608 --> 00:00:09.060
Hard requirements are checked line by line.

4
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:12.088
Click a visa signal to see the posting's exact words.

5
00:00:12.088 --> 00:00:16.868
This one needs an immediate start and you haven't graduated, so the score is capped: Skip.

6
00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:19.416
The red flag and summary say why.

7
00:00:19.416 --> 00:00:22.636
Skips are remembered too; reopening won't re-analyze.
